<NAME>Proposal Copy Count</NAME>
<CONTENT>In the sample investment management RFP, the required number of hard copies is <b>six (6)</b>. The relevant language appears in Part 6, Section 6.2 (“RFP Due Date & Delivery”), which says: “Six (6) copies of the proposal must be received by IMRF…”

The evidence also adds that:
- the six copies must be received by the specified deadline,
- they must be addressed and delivered to IMRF at the listed Oak Brook, Illinois address, and
- electronic submission is also acceptable if sent by email before the same deadline.

So, the answer to how many copies must be sent is: <b>six copies</b>.</CONTENT>
