[role=assistant] <DESCRIPTION>The Apple Valley Fire Protection District’s 2024 RFP specifies exact valuation dates in the Scope of Work. It requires biennial OPEB valuations for three even-year dates and biennial roll-forward updates for the intervening odd-year dates.</DESCRIPTION>
<NAME>Required OPEB Dates.</NAME>
<CONTENT>According to the Apple Valley Fire Protection District’s 2024 RFP, the actuary must deliver:

- Biennial OPEB valuations as of:
  - June 30, 2024
  - June 30, 2026
  - June 30, 2028

- Biennial OPEB roll-forward updates as of:
  - June 30, 2025
  - June 30, 2027
  - June 30, 2029

These dates appear in the RFP’s Scope of Work, which states that the actuary must “deliver OPEB related biennial valuations” for 2024, 2026, and 2028, and “deliver OPEB biennial roll-forward updates” for 2025, 2027, and 2029.</CONTENT>
