<NAME>Audit firm and term limit.</NAME>
<CONTENT>In INPRS RFP 24-05 for audit services, the document says that <b>RSM</b> has provided INPRS’s external audit services <b>since 2014</b>.

The RFP also explains that INPRS’s procurement policy, as stated in the INPRS Board Governance Manual, <b>limits contract length to 10 years</b> and <b>requires solicitation of new bids no less frequently than every 10 years</b>.

In addition, Section 4.1 of the RFP aligns with that policy by stating that the contract will have an <b>initial term of 5 years</b>, with one or more renewals at INPRS’s option, but the <b>total contract period may not exceed 10 years</b>.</CONTENT>
