# Markdown Briefing

## Audit Firm and Service Start
- **RSM** has provided **INPRS’s external audit services since 2014**.

## Contract Length Limit
- INPRS’s procurement policy **limits contract length to 10 years**.
- The policy also **requires solicitation of new bids at least every 10 years**.

## RFP 24-05 Contract Terms
- Section 4.1 provides for an **initial term of 5 years**.
- The contract may include **one or more renewals at INPRS’s option**.
- However, the **total contract period may not exceed 10 years**.

## Bottom Line
- The incumbent audit firm is **RSM**, serving since **2014**.
- INPRS policy caps audit contracts at **10 years total** and requires **rebidding no less frequently than every 10 years**.
</SUMMARY>
