- have “at least **$500 billion U.S. dollars in total assets under custody**... [including] at least **$100 billion U.S. dollars in international equity and fixed income**”; and
- “Provide the liability, professional errors and omissions insurance in the minimum amount of **$75 million U.S. dollars**.”
