<NAME>FoF / MM DDQ key facts.</NAME>
<CONTENT>- The INREV Due Diligence Questionnaire 2022 for Funds of Funds and Multi Manager says the **FoF / MM questionnaire was originally launched in 2014**.  
- At the front of the DDQ, there are **two additions**:  
  1. **a Vehicle Fact Sheet** – providing a snapshot of the basic high-level vehicle information; and  
  2. **a Funds of Funds / Multi Manager Statement** – giving the manager the opportunity to showcase its platform and expertise.  
