<CONTENT>The relevant due diligence questionnaire is the <b>Due Diligence Questionnaire for Non-Listed Real Estate Investment Vehicles</b>.

The relevant language appears in section <b>3.8 Environmental, Social and Governance (ESG) Issues</b>, specifically question <b>3.8.1</b>, which asks:

- <b>“Do you submit data to the Global Real Estate Sustainability Benchmark (GRESB) report?”</b>
- It then follows with: <b>“If so, what is the score? How has the score changed since participating in GRESB?”</b>

So, the questionnaire that asks the manager about submitting sustainability-related data is the <b>Non-Listed Real Estate Investment Vehicles DDQ</b>, and the organisation it gives as the example is <b>Global Real Estate Sustainability Benchmark (GRESB)</b>.</CONTENT>
