[role=assistant] <DESCRIPTION>According to the ILPA Due Diligence Questionnaire v1.2, version 1.1 was released in September 2016. It introduced reporting-template compliance questions, revised the Governance and Risk/Compliance/ESG sections to reflect PRI’s new LP Responsible Investment DDQ, and refreshed web links, font, and formatting.</DESCRIPTION>
<NAME>ILPA DDQ v1.1 changes.</NAME>
<CONTENT>Version 1.1 of the ILPA Due Diligence Questionnaire was released in September 2016.

The changes introduced in version 1.1 were:
- New questions were added regarding compliance with the ILPA Reporting Template, which had been released in January 2016. These additions were made to the “Accounting / Valuation / Reporting” sections.
- The original “Governance” and “Risk / Compliance / ESG” sections were revised to reflect PRI’s new LP Responsible Investment DDQ. This revision also included re-ordering, merging, and editing existing questions in those sections.
- Existing web links, as well as the font and formatting, were refreshed as needed.</CONTENT>
