# Markdown Briefing: ILPA DDQ v1.1 Changes

## Release Date
- **Version 1.1** of the **ILPA Due Diligence Questionnaire** was released in **September 2016**.

## Key Changes Introduced
- **Added reporting-template compliance questions**
  - New questions were introduced regarding compliance with the **ILPA Reporting Template** released in **January 2016**.
  - These were added to the **Accounting / Valuation / Reporting** sections.

- **Revised Governance and Risk/Compliance/ESG sections**
  - The **Governance** and **Risk / Compliance / ESG** sections were updated to align with **PRI’s new LP Responsible Investment DDQ**.
  - This included **re-ordering, merging, and editing** existing questions in those sections.

- **Refreshed presentation and links**
  - **Web links**, as well as **font and formatting**, were updated as needed.

## Bottom Line
Version 1.1 primarily focused on **reporting-template compliance**, **responsible-investment alignment**, and **editorial/formatting updates**.
</SUMMARY>
