<NAME>LAGERS client minimum</NAME>
<CONTENT>Under Section 3, “Minimum Requirements,” item 5 of the Missouri LAGERS RFP, the respondent “must provide non-discretionary private market investment consulting to at least three public fund clients with assets of at least $10 billion” as of March 31, 2024.

So the requirement is:
- Number of public fund clients: at least 3
- Minimum size of each client: at least $10 billion in assets</CONTENT>
