[role=assistant] <DESCRIPTION>The Broward Education Foundation RFP is the one that limits proposals to five single-spaced typewritten pages. It requires six copies of the proposal, submitted no later than 5 PM on July 1, 2016.</DESCRIPTION>
<NAME>Copies and deadline</NAME>
<CONTENT>The relevant RFP is for investment manager services for Broward Education Foundation, Inc. In the section on proposal length, it states that the proposal should be no longer than 5 single-spaced typewritten pages, not including backup documents, and that references and samples may be included as addenda without counting toward the 5-page limit.

For submission, the RFP requires six (6) copies of the proposal. These must be submitted to Thomas P. Severino, President and CEO, at the Broward Education Foundation, 600 SE Third Avenue, Ft. Lauderdale, FL 33301.

The submission deadline is no later than 5 PM on July 1, 2016. The RFP also states that no proposal will be considered if it is received after that time and date or if it is incomplete.</CONTENT>
[role=assistant] <SUMMARY>
# Markdown Briefing

## Answer
For the Broward Education Foundation RFP for **investment manager services**:

- **Copies required:** **Six (6) copies**
- **Submission deadline:** **No later than 5:00 PM on July 1, 2016**

## Supporting Details
- The proposal is limited to **5 single-spaced typewritten pages**.
- **Backup documents** are excluded from the page limit.
- **References and samples** may be included as addenda and do **not** count toward the 5-page limit.
- Proposals submitted **after the deadline** or **incomplete** proposals will **not be considered**.
</SUMMARY>
